---
import MockFrame from './MockFrame.astro';
// Same conversation as ShopAnswerMock, continued. The escalation itself is
// real and quotable from the system prompt: "Do not answer if you do not
// know" and, for complaints, "Do not handle complain by yourself. Use
// ticket tool to create support tickets for customer complain." — the
// backend, config/default_prompts/default_chat_prompt.
// There is no fixed on-screen ticket-confirmation string to quote: the
// tool's own return value ("Ticket ID=#{ticket_id} created successfully.",
// logics/shop_tools/create_customer_service_ticket.py) is fed back to the
// model, which paraphrases it for the shopper in a normal chat reply — so
// the reply text below is a minimal, invented paraphrase, not a quoted
// string, kept deliberately short per that gap. The word it names,
// "refund", is one of the tool's real four ticket types: refund, return,
// cancel, generic — the backend, classes/tenant.py TicketType.
// Waiting state: typing dots with no text (assets/newChatv6.js:508-518).
// Source: local_pm/research/2026-09-24-shopmgr-ui-walkthrough.md, "3. The assistant escalates…".
---
<MockFrame title="Shopmgr — Store A" meta="Live">
  <div class="space-y-2.5">
    <div class="flex justify-start">
      <p class="mock-step max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-snug text-fg" style="--step: 0">
        Sure — that ships within 3 business days.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1">
      <p class="mock-step max-w-[78%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-action px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-snug text-on-action" style="--step: 1">
        It arrived damaged — can I get a refund?
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mock-step flex justify-start" style="--step: 2">
      <div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-[12px] leading-snug text-fg">
        <div class="grid">
          <span class="mock-before col-start-1 row-start-1 text-fg-subtle" style="--swap: 3"><span aria-hidden="true">• • •</span></span>
          <span class="mock-step col-start-1 row-start-1" style="--step: 3">
            I can't process a refund myself, so I've raised this as a refund ticket for our team to review.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MockFrame>
